      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ENTRAPMENT (4) broke her maiden last start over 1300m at Darwin when resuming, scoring by 5.5 lengths. Rates highly on the back of that effort in her first start for the new stable. Can go on with the job now. SHASFA (2) got home by 1.1 lengths on dirt at Broome two starts ago. Disappointed in another run on dirt last time at Broome over 1300m when fourth. Looks a strong chance to find winning form here. DUMMY SPIT (3) made progress last time out, finishing 3.5 lengths from the winner in second at the end of 1435m at Broome. Has the talent to produce another positive result. OUR COUVER (1) was unplaced two runs back then again missed the frame last start over 1300m at Darwin, finishing in eighth. Finds a nice race and can atone. PERCUSSION PRINCE (5) rounds out the field.",
